; margin: 0; color: var(--muted-foreground)\"\n    >↑ Scroll back up</p\n  >\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Horizontal","html":"<div\n  style=\"\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  \"\n>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; width: max-content; align-items: stretch\">\n    <p style=\"flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 24rem; margin: 0; color: var(--muted-foreground)\"\n      >Scroll sideways →</p\n    >\n    <section\n      class=\"parallax\"\n      data-axis=\"inline\"\n      style=\"flex: none; width: 56rem; height: 18rem; background: #bfe3ff\"\n      aria-label=\"A sideways scene\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"parallax-layer\" style=\"--parallax-speed: 40%; z-index: -4\"\n        ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"70\" r=\"26\" fill=\"#fff3b0\" />\n          <g fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\".9\">\n            <ellipse cx=\"300\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"12\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"520\" cy=\"80\" rx=\"55\" ry=\"14\" />\n            <ellipse cx=\"700\" cy=\"50\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"10\" />\n          </g></svg\n      ></div>\n      <div class=\"parallax-layer\" style=\"--parallax-speed: 22%; z-index: -3\"\n        ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMax slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path\n            d=\"M0 210 L80 150 L160 200 L260 130 L360 190 L460 140 L560 200 L660 150 L800 190 V300 H0Z\"\n            fill=\"#7aa6c2\"\n          /></svg\n      ></div>\n      <div class=\"parallax-layer\" style=\"--parallax-speed: -12%; z-index: -2\"\n        ><svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMax slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M0 250 Q100 215 200 245 T400 240 T600 235 T800 245 V300 H0Z\" fill=\"#3f6f5a\" /></svg\n      ></div>\n      <div class=\"parallax-content\" style=\"display: grid; place-items: center; height: 100%\"\n        ><strong style=\"font-size: 1.5rem\">The inline axis</strong></div\n      >\n    </section>\n    <p style=\"flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 24rem; margin: 0; color: var(--muted-foreground)\"\n      >← and back</p\n    >\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
